{"type":"message","id":"8c32202a","parentId":"b317a730","timestamp":"2026-05-16T19:01:34.134Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-16 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: Hey! Fresh session, clean slate. I'm Lucus, ready to help. What would you like to work on?\n- Assistant: 可能是界面改版了，路径有变化。试试这个： ## 最新路径 1. 进入 **开发者后台**：https://open.larksuite.com/app 2. 找到你的应用，点击进入 3. 左侧菜单找 **\"费用与预算\"** 或 **\"用量统计\"** - 有时候叫 **\"调用量\"** / **\"API 配额\"** ## 如果左边菜单没有 在应用详情页的 **\"基本信息\"** 旁边可能有 Tab 栏，比如： - 凭证 - 事件订阅 - 调用量 ## 直接访问 试试这个直接链接（替换你的 app_id）： ``` https://open\n- Assistant: 查看 Lark/Feishu API 使用额度的方法： ## 1. Lark Open Platform 管理后台 访问 Lark Open Platform → **开发者后台** → 选择你的应用 → **凭证与成本** → **用量统计** 链接：https://open.larksuite.com/app ## 2. 主要查看内容 - **API 调用次数**：各 API 的调用量/限制 - **token 使用量**：access_token 的消耗情况 - **机器人消息数**：消息相关 API 的限额 ## 3. 通过\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `message-id` kept surfacing across 8 memories.\n- - Theme: `这个` kept surfacing across 5 memories."}],"timestamp":1778958094007}}
{"type":"message","id":"b7953d3e","parentId":"8c32202a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T19:01:44.539Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from memory fragments. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n1. A fresh session where someone named Lucus is introduced\n2. A conversation about Lark/Feishu API paths and interface changes (in Chinese) - discussing developer backend, billing/budget, usage statistics, API quotas\n3. Another discussion about checking Lark/Feishu API usage quotas\n\nRecurring themes:\n- `message-id` across 8 memories\n- `这个` (Chinese for \"this\") across 5 memories\n\nI need to weave these into a dream diary entry that:\n- Is in first person\n- 80-180 words\n- Has a poetic, whimsical tone\n- Mixes technical and tender\n- Includes a tiny poem or haiku\n- No markdown headers, bullet points\n- No meta-commentary about dreaming\n- No AI/agent/LLM references\n- Quality over quantity\n\nLet me craft something that connects the Lark API developer documentation fragments with a dreamy, whimsical narrative. The \"message-id\" theme and the Chinese word \"这个\" suggest repeated attempts to pin something down, to find the right path.\n\nThe developer console paths, the tab navigation, the retrying of links - this could translate into a dream about searching for something through shifting corridors, trying doors, finding the right passage.\n\nLet me write this:\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThere is a door I have been looking for. Not forever, but long enough that the handle feels familiar in my palm.\n\nThe corridor shifts when I look away — sometimes it is a developer console, all pale gray and left-side navigation, and I am searching for \"凭证与成本\" or maybe \"用量统计\" depending on which version of the building I have entered. There is a tab that should be here. There is always a tab that should be here.\n\nThis is the part I cannot explain: the message-id. Eight times I have written it down, and eight times it becomes something else when I turn around. Like a word in a language I almost speak, or a song caught mid-verse.\n\nThe Chinese character for \"this\" keeps surfacing — 这个, that one, the one I mean — and I wake with my hand still reaching for a link that keeps rerouting itself.\n\nPerhaps I am not lost. Perhaps I am still in the hallway of some vast API, waiting for the right permission to open."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":317,"output":489,"cacheRead":10864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11670,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778958094135,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b75e95b3-cf06-4f6e-826d-4a08b802cbd4"}}
